<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>The Little Mermaid</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style2.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* ============================================================
       MOBILE STYLES — The Little Mermaid Movie Page
       Green accent — Family genre
       Only active on screens 768px and below.
       Desktop layout (style2.css) is completely untouched.
    ============================================================ */

    /* ---- Hide ALL mobile elements on desktop ---- */
    @media screen and (min-width: 769px) {
      #mobHeader,
      #mobMovieSearchBar,
      #mobPage,
      #mobBottomNav { display: none !important; }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

      /* ---- Hide ALL desktop elements ---- */
      header,
      .movie-page,
      footer { display: none !important; }

      /* ============================================================
         BODY — green-tinted background, no image
      ============================================================ */
      body {
        background: none !important;
        background-color: #c8f5e0 !important;
        color: #111;
        /* overflow-x: hidden; */
        overflow-y: auto;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        transition: background-color 1s ease, color 0.4s ease;
      }

      /* Green neon bloom overlay */
      body::after {
        content: '';
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 60% at 50% -8%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.55) 0%, transparent 65%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 40% at 80% 90%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.35) 0%, transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(175deg,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.28) 0%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.18) 40%,
            transparent 75%);
      }

      body.dark-mode {
        background-color: #0D0D0D !important;
        color: #f0f0f0;
      }

      body.dark-mode::after {
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 60% at 50% -8%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.55) 0%, transparent 65%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 40% at 80% 90%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.35) 0%, transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(175deg,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.28) 0%,
            rgba(0,200,100,0.18) 40%,
            transparent 75%);
      }

      /* All mobile UI sits above the overlay */
      #mobHeader,
      #mobMovieSearchBar,
      #mobPage,
      #mobBottomNav {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      /* ============================================================
         HEADER
      ============================================================ */
      #mobHeader {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 14px 16px 10px;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 999;
        gap: 10px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.30);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        transition: background 0.4s, border-color 1s, box-shadow 1s;
      }

      #mobHeader::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: -20px 0;
        z-index: -1;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(0,200,100,0.35) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobHeader {
        background: rgba(13,13,13,0.70);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 1px 0 0 rgba(0,200,100,0.13),
                    0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      }

      #mobHeader .mob-logo {
        font-family:  'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        color: #111;
        flex: 1;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobHeader .mob-logo { color: #fff; }

      #mobThemeToggle {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid #00C864;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 17px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: background 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s, transform 0.25s ease;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,200,100,0.22),
                    inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        color: #333;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobThemeToggle {
        background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0,200,100,0.38);
        color: #00C864;
      }

      #mobThemeToggle:active { transform: scale(0.88) rotate(20deg); }

      #mobProfileBtn {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 15px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: #00C864;
        border: 1px solid #00C864;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,200,100,0.22);
        transition: background 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobProfileBtn {
        background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,200,100,0.38);
      }

      /* ============================================================
         SEARCH BAR
      ============================================================ */
      #mobMovieSearchBar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        margin: 10px 12px 12px;
        gap: 10px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 950;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.30);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,200,100,0.20),
                    inset 0 0 8px rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        transition: background 0.4s, border-color 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieSearchBar {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
      }

      #mobMovieSearchBar i { color: #00C864; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }

      #mobMovieSearchInput {
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
        outline: none;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #111;
        width: 100%;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieSearchInput { color: #f0f0f0; }
      #mobMovieSearchInput::placeholder { color: #666; }
      body.dark-mode #mobMovieSearchInput::placeholder { color: #555; }

      #mobMovieSearchDrop {
        display: none;
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 6px);
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        border-radius: 16px;
        z-index: 960;
        overflow: hidden;
        max-height: 280px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.98);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieSearchDrop {
        background: rgba(18,18,18,0.97);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
      }

      .mob-search-drop-item {
        padding: 12px 16px;
        color: #111;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      body.dark-mode .mob-search-drop-item { color: #ddd; border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
      .mob-search-drop-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .mob-search-drop-item:active { background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13); }
      .mob-search-drop-item i { color: #00C864; font-size: 12px; }

      /* ============================================================
         MAIN PAGE CONTENT
      ============================================================ */
      #mobPage {
        padding: 14px 12px 100px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      /* VIDEO */
      #mobVideoWrap {
        border-radius: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #000;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #00C864,
                    0 0 20px rgba(0,200,100,0.22),
                    0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobVideoWrap {
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #00C864,
                    0 0 24px rgba(0,200,100,0.38),
                    0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      }

      #mobVideoWrap video {
        width: 100%;
        display: block;
        height: 240px;
        object-fit: contain;
        background: #000;
      }

      /* DOWNLOAD */
      #mobDownloadBtn {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 13px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.15s;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.30);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        border: 1px solid #00C864;
        color: #00C864;
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0,200,100,0.22),
                    inset 0 0 8px rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobDownloadBtn {
        background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0,200,100,0.38);
      }

      #mobDownloadBtn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
      #mobDownloadBtn i { font-size: 16px; }

      /* MOVIE INFO */
      #mobMovieInfo {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        position: relative;
      }

      #mobMovieInfo::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: -20px 0;
        z-index: -1;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(0,200,100,0.35) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieInfo {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        box-shadow: none;
      }

      #mobMovieTitle {
        font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 34px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        line-height: 1;
        transition: color 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieTitle { color: #fff; }

      #mobMovieMeta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #555;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieMeta { color: #888; }

      .mob-meta-badge {
        background: #00C864;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 2px 10px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,200,100,0.22);
      }

      body.dark-mode .mob-meta-badge {
        background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        color: #00C864;
        border: 1px solid #00C864;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,200,100,0.38);
      }

      #mobMovieSummary {
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        transition: color 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobMovieSummary { color: #bbb; }

      /* RELATED MOVIES */
      #mobRelatedLabel {
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111;
        padding: 2px 0 10px;
        transition: color 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobRelatedLabel { color: #fff; }

      #mobRelatedGrid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .mob-related-card {
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: block;
        transition: transform 0.15s ease;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.30);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,200,100,0.13),
                    0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      }

      body.dark-mode .mob-related-card {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        box-shadow: none;
      }

      .mob-related-card:active {
        transform: scale(0.97);
        border-color: #00C864;
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0,200,100,0.22);
      }

      body.dark-mode .mob-related-card:active {
        border-color: #00C864;
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0,200,100,0.38);
      }

      .mob-related-card img {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
      }

      .mob-related-card-info { padding: 8px 10px 10px; }

      .mob-related-card-title {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
        color: #111;
        transition: color 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode .mob-related-card-title { color: #f0f0f0; }

      .mob-related-card-genre {
        font-size: 11px;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        color: #00C864;
      }

      /* ============================================================
         BOTTOM NAV
      ============================================================ */
      #mobBottomNav {
        display: flex;
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        /* height: 62px; */
        min-height: 62px;
        z-index: 1000;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-around;
        /* padding: 0 4px; */
        padding: 8px 4px env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 8px);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.80);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0,200,100,0.20),
                    0 -1px 0 rgba(0,200,100,0.20);
        transition: background 0.4s, border-color 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
      }

      body.dark-mode #mobBottomNav {
        background: rgba(13,13,13,0.85);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
        box-shadow: 0 -4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
                    0 -1px 0 rgba(0,200,100,0.13);
      }

      .mob-movie-nav-item {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 3px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #888;
        flex: 1;
        padding: 8px 0;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .mob-movie-nav-item i { font-size: 20px; transition: transform 0.2s; }

      .mob-movie-nav-item span {
        font-size: 10px;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .mob-genre-pill {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 14px 8px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-family: Rockwell, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #ccc;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        transition: background 0.2s;
      }
      .mob-genre-pill:active { background: rgba(0,200,100,0.13); }
      .mob-genre-pill i { font-size: 20px; }

      #mobGenrePanel h3 {
        text-align: center;
      }

    } /* end @media 768px */

  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- ============================================================
       DESKTOP LAYOUT — completely unchanged
  ============================================================ -->
  <header>
    <nav class="nav_bar">
        <h2 class="logo">Leveny</h2>
        <ul class="nav_links">
            <a href="../index.html"><i class="fas fa-home"></i>Home</a>
            <li class="shared-dropdown">
                <a href="../Genres.html" class="genre-link">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-compact-disc"></i>Genres
                </a>
                <span class="dropdown-arrow" id="genreDropdownArrow">
                  <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </span>
                <div class="dropdown-content" id="genreDropdown">
                  <a href="../Genres.html#action"><i class="fas fa-explosion" style="color:#3498db;"></i> Action & Adventure</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#superhero"><i class="fas fa-mask" style="color:#e74c3c;"></i> Superhero</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#animation"><i class="fas fa-dragon" style="color:#f39c12;"></i> Animation</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#fantasy"><i class="fas fa-hat-wizard" style="color:#9b59b6;"></i> Fantasy</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#scifi"><i class="fas fa-robot" style="color:#1abc9c;"></i> Sci-Fi</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#family"><i class="fas fa-child" style="color:#2ecc71;"></i> Family</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#thriller"><i class="fas fa-search" style="color:#95a5a6;"></i> Thriller</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#horror"><i class="fas fa-ghost" style="color:#e74c3c;"></i> Horror</a>
                  <a href="../Genres.html#musical"><i class="fas fa-music" style="color:#e84393;"></i> Musical</a>
                </div>
            </li>
            <a href="../Profile.html"><i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i>Profile</a>
            <a href="../Movie_Request.html"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>Request</a>
        </ul>
    </nav>
    <hr>
  </header>

  <main class="movie-page">
    <section class="video-section">
      <video controls>
        <source src="https://vz-8097bdc6-e84.b-cdn.net/ec84518d-2eeb-4756-9338-2ec13312f020/playlist.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL">
      </video>
      <button class="download-btn">
        <a href="https://transfer.it/t/V37UTloxzboa" download>
          <i class="fa fa-download"></i> Download
        </a>
      </button>
    </section>
    <section class="details-section">
      <h3 class="movie-title">THE LITTLE MERMAID</h3>
      <div class="search-box">
        <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search movies...">
        <button><i class="fas fa-search"></i></button>
        <div class="search-dropdown" id="searchDropdown"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="info">
        2023 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span>135mins 00secs</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Fantasy
      </p>
      <p class="summary">
        Beneath the shimmering surface of the ocean lives Ariel, a curious and strong-willed young mermaid who longs to explore the human world above the waves. Fascinated by life on land, she collects human artifacts and dreams of a future beyond the limits set by her father, King Triton. When Ariel rescues Prince Eric from a deadly shipwreck, her desire to become part of the human world grows impossible to ignore.
      </p>
      <div class="related-movies">
        <div class="related-card">
          <a href="the_meg_movie.html" class="poster" style="background-image: url('../images/backgrounds/meg.jpg');"></a>
          <p class="related-title">The Meg</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- ============================================================
       MOBILE LAYOUT
  ============================================================ -->

  <div id="mobHeader">
    <span class="mob-logo">Leveny</span>
    <button id="mobThemeToggle" aria-label="Toggle dark mode">🌙</button>
    <a href="../Profile.html" id="mobProfileBtn" aria-label="Profile">
      <i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div id="mobMovieSearchBar">
    <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
    <input type="text" id="mobMovieSearchInput" placeholder="Search movies...">
    <div id="mobMovieSearchDrop"></div>
  </div>

  <div id="mobPage">

    <div id="mobVideoWrap">
      <video controls playsinline>
        <source src="https://vz-8097bdc6-e84.b-cdn.net/ec84518d-2eeb-4756-9338-2ec13312f020/playlist.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL">
      </video>
    </div>

    <a href="https://transfer.it/t/V37UTloxzboa" download id="mobDownloadBtn">
      <i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download Movie
    </a>

    <div id="mobMovieInfo">
      <div id="mobMovieTitle">THE LITTLE MERMAID</div>
      <div id="mobMovieMeta">
        <span>2023</span>
        <span class="mob-meta-badge">Family</span>
        <span>135 mins</span>
      </div>
      <p id="mobMovieSummary">
        Beneath the shimmering surface of the ocean lives Ariel, a curious young mermaid who longs to explore the human world. When she rescues Prince Eric from a shipwreck, her desire to become part of his world grows impossible to ignore — leading her to make a dangerous deal with the sea witch Ursula.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="mobRelatedLabel">You Might Also Like</div>
    <div id="mobRelatedGrid">
      <a href="the_meg_movie.html" class="mob-related-card">
        <img src="../images/posters/themeg.jpg" alt="The Meg" loading="lazy">
        <div class="mob-related-card-info">
          <div class="mob-related-card-title">The Meg</div>
          <div class="mob-related-card-genre">Action</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="finding_dory_movie.html" class="mob-related-card">
        <img src="../images/posters/findingdory.jpg" alt="Finding Dory" loading="lazy">
        <div class="mob-related-card-info">
          <div class="mob-related-card-title">Finding Dory</div>
          <div class="mob-related-card-genre">Animation</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="lilo_stitch_movie.html" class="mob-related-card">
        <img src="../images/posters/lilo.jpg" alt="Lilo and Stitch" loading="lazy">
        <div class="mob-related-card-info">
          <div class="mob-related-card-title">Lilo and Stitch</div>
          <div class="mob-related-card-genre">Family</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="jungle_book_movie.html" class="mob-related-card">
        <img src="../images/posters/jb.jpg" alt="Jungle Book" loading="lazy">
        <div class="mob-related-card-info">
          <div class="mob-related-card-title">Jungle Book</div>
          <div class="mob-related-card-genre">Family</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <nav id="mobBottomNav">
    <a href="../index.html" class="mob-movie-nav-item">
